# =============================================================================
# A-Zone Odoo VM (WorldPosta / CloudEdge) — Tailscale (2026-06-28)
# Tailscale: worldposta-azone @ 100.115.138.9
# Internal (VPN): 172.20.1.1 | Public SNAT: 37.61.219.169
# Primary SSH user: sabry (after setup-azone-master-access.sh on VM)
